const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文讨论在公司掌握而外部投资者不掌握信息时，融资与投资决策会如何受到影响。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article develops how financing and investment decisions can be affected when firms possess information that outside investors do not have. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它是关于逆向选择与融资选择的理论分析，不是一套可直接运行的实证评分或预测系统。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It is a theoretical analysis of adverse-selection and financing choices, not a ready-made empirical scoring or prediction system. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"经验应用需要带日期的融资公告、投资机会、发行条款、公司信息代理、投资者信息集和制度规则。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"An empirical application would need dated financing announcements, investment opportunities, security issuance terms, firm information proxies, investor information sets, and institutional rules. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"框架解释一种信息不对称机制，而不诊断私有信息或某项融资决策的质量。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The framework explains a possible information-asymmetry mechanism; it does not diagnose private information or the quality of a particular financing decision. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"明确模型假设、融资工具、公告时钟、反事实以及投资机会和信息不对称的测量方式。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"State the model assumptions, financing instruments, announcement clock, counterfactual, and how investment opportunities and information asymmetry are measured. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Economics (1984)。理论机制不能独自为发行人分类、给证券定价或提供资本结构建议。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Economics (1984). A theoretical mechanism cannot by itself classify an issuer, price a security, or provide a capital-structure recommendation. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405x(84)90023-0",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (1984) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Corporate Financing and Investment Decisions When Firms Have Information That Investors Do Not Have”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。理论机制不能独自为发行人分类、给证券定价或提供资本结构建议。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Corporate Financing and Investment Decisions When Firms Have Information That Investors Do Not Have”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
